00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:29.114
ir hot geredt vegn ayer zayn in di militer.

00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:30.802
rumenishe militer.

00:00:30.319 --> 00:00:31.140
yo.

00:00:31.399 --> 00:00:34.245
in nayntsn akht un draysik biz

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.310
nayntsn akht un dray-

00:00:34.622 --> 00:00:36.040
nayntsn fertsik

00:00:34.723 --> 00:00:36.877
bizn nayntsn fertsik.

00:00:37.305 --> 00:00:39.040
fertsik in di

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.430
kimat befor s'hot zikh ongehoybn di milkhome eyn un fertsik

00:00:42.486 --> 00:00:44.555
in di ende fun nayntsn fertsik.

00:00:45.777 --> 00:00:49.213
yo. ir vilt, ikh muz aykh gibn a bisl a baloykhtung

00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:52.295
vos meynt azoyns in der rumenisher militer

00:00:52.295 --> 00:00:54.613
bazunders far a yidishn soldat

00:00:55.058 --> 00:00:58.393
vayl der antisemitizm iz geven shtark farshpreyt

