un z- di eyntsike zakh vos zey hobn geshtrebt, es zoln shoyn vern a leytenant, a SUB leytenant

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:18.310
oder an, a bisl a

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:21.750
az er zol zikh kenen izdekeven oyf di yidishe soldatn.

00:01:21.822 --> 00:01:23.284
dos iz geven zeyer tsil.

00:01:23.779 --> 00:01:26.237
ven ikh bin ongekumen keyn IASI

00:01:28.302 --> 00:01:30.844
iz, bin ikh,

00:01:31.407 --> 00:01:34.382
gevezn, azoy vi ikh hob gezogt, oyvn

00:01:34.382 --> 00:01:39.450
in da- in a, a UNIT ANTIAERIANE.

00:01:40.317 --> 00:01:43.433
dos iz gevezn oyf der ⟨SERERIER⟩ gas

00:01:45.025 --> 00:01:47.736
es iz geven zeyer a shtrenge

00:01:50.396 --> 00:01:51.684
atmosfere.

00:01:51.927 --> 00:01:54.992
zeyer a shtrenge ordenung

00:01:55.369 --> 00:01:58.333
BECAUSE dos iz gevezn a naye

00:01:58.339 --> 00:02:01.775
UNIT velekhe i- Rumenye hot dos friert nisht gehat.

00:02:02.018 --> 00:02:04.310
MO- merer modern

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.706
vayl Rumenye iz geven opgeshtanen i- mit

00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:08.250
di artilerye

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:11.380
opgeshtanen in industrye. dos ales hobn zey bakumen

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:13.127
fun CZECHOSLOVAKIA

00:02:13.127 --> 00:02:15.237
un m'hot on- gedarft onheybn tsu lernen

00:02:15.237 --> 00:02:18.277
hot men gegibn nisht a yor mit akht khadoshim

00:02:18.277 --> 00:02:20.477
di soldatn zoln dinen nor dray yor

00:02:20.477 --> 00:02:22.717
un ikh bin arayngefaln oyf di dray.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:25.698
ikh muz dertseyln etlekhe epizodn fun dem

00:02:25.698 --> 00:02:28.607
vet zayn klor ver iz azoyns di rumenishe

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.572
m- di rumenishe, ofitsirn.

00:02:34.165 --> 00:02:35.779
oyf eyn mol

00:02:38.907 --> 00:02:40.521
in, nokh dem

00:02:40.628 --> 00:02:41.854
vos me makht

00:02:42.214 --> 00:02:45.549
di in bay tog di ibungen

00:02:45.994 --> 00:02:47.434
makht di ibungen

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:53.700
oyfn feld fun zamd UNK me varft zikh oyf der erd un me krikht un me shist un me loyft

00:02:53.976 --> 00:02:56.934
iz vern di kleyder shtark

00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.006
shmutsik

00:02:58.006 --> 00:03:01.344
darfn zey, aheymkumen ven me kumt aheym in DORMITOR

00:03:01.637 --> 00:03:04.790
darfn zey oysklapn az se zol nit zayn mit

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.930
mit shtekenes ⟨me darf⟩ zey oysklapn, un di kleyder zenen geven

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:09.680
keday tsu dermonen zenen geven

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:11.570
shineln, nisht keyn dine

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.900
azoy vi hayntike militerishe kleyder

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.439
vos zenen nisht ⟨tsu zikh⟩ azoy

00:03:15.439 --> 00:03:17.709
s'iz geven grobe gevant aza min

00:03:17.787 --> 00:03:19.674
mit, iz dos geven mit

00:03:19.674 --> 00:03:21.243
mit shtoyb

00:03:21.243 --> 00:03:24.415
fun yorn fun soldatn vos zey hobn gedint fun frier

00:03:24.415 --> 00:03:27.770
keynem hot men nisht gegibn keyn naye kleyder. m'hot gegibn alte kleyder.

00:03:28.502 --> 00:03:30.420
a mol hot men gegibn naye kleyder.

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:32.326
s'hot nisht geklekt.

00:03:32.451 --> 00:03:33.575
iz

00:03:33.615 --> 00:03:35.499
az mir ze'mir gekumen tsurik

00:03:35.657 --> 00:03:37.287
hot men zikh gedarft opruen.

00:03:37.287 --> 00:03:39.927
m'hot oysgeklapt di kleyder ⟨un iz⟩ gegangen vashn di fis.

00:03:39.927 --> 00:03:42.827
az me geyt vashn di fis in, in ahintsu tsu

00:03:42.827 --> 00:03:45.527
hot men gedarft geyn UNK in dem gantsn DORMITOR

00:03:45.527 --> 00:03:48.175
mit di borvese fis tsurik tsu di betlekh

00:03:48.175 --> 00:03:50.625
iz hot er ge- hot men azoy gemakht

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:52.695
az me zol aroysshteln di fis

00:03:52.695 --> 00:03:57.212
oyf di ayzerne betlekh un iberdekn d- mit di BLANKETES ibern kop

00:03:57.212 --> 00:04:00.592
un der CAPORAL vos er iz d- SHOMER

00:04:00.592 --> 00:04:03.932
geyt arum un, un kontrolirt tsi di fis zenen reyn

00:04:03.932 --> 00:04:08.220
ober az m'iz gegangen fun dortn biz ahintsu tsu, zenen shoyn di fis geven a bisl shmutsik

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.991
hot er geshlogn mitn BELT

00:04:10.099 --> 00:04:11.994
geshlogn azoy lang biz blut.

00:04:11.994 --> 00:04:14.289
nor az tomer iz er tsugekumen tsun a yidn

00:04:14.289 --> 00:04:17.850
hot er iberge- ibergekert dem BELT mitn ayzernem

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:19.209
sprontshik un hot geshlogn

00:04:19.209 --> 00:04:20.279
un hot nisht getort

00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:21.839
tsuriknemen di fis

00:04:21.839 --> 00:04:23.819
kholile unter der BLANKET

00:04:23.819 --> 00:04:24.690
tomer yo

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.490
hot er geharget geshlogn

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.610
nokh merer

00:04:28.138 --> 00:04:32.064
un hot dokh shoyn geshtroft az du zolst zayn di tsveyte SHMIRA

00:04:32.307 --> 00:04:35.138
di tsveyte,

00:04:35.138 --> 00:04:39.155
 vi azoy zogt men? zolst arayngeyn in der, in d- in, in f-

00:04:39.155 --> 00:04:42.293
di ershte heybt zikh on akht a zeyger oyf der nakht

00:04:42.293 --> 00:04:44.923
un di ts- un di tsveyte geyt f- heybt zikh on

00:04:45.047 --> 00:04:46.897
tsvey a zeyger bay nakht

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.990
gey- shtelt er dikh avek, iz biz akht

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:51.510
biz tsvelef a zeyger shlogt men dikh in di fis

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:54.970
un nokh dem shtelt er dikh avek tsvey a zeyger bay nakht az du zolst dezhurn

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:56.810
du zolst zayn der sh- der SHOMER.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:05:00.214
darfstu shoyn zayn biz gants fri, un gants fri darfstu shoyn geyn

00:05:00.214 --> 00:05:01.311
nokh a mol oyf

00:05:01.311 --> 00:05:02.321
ibungen

00:05:02.428 --> 00:05:05.915
ot azoy fleg men tun mit di yidishe soldatn bazunders.

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.075
oyf di yidn.

00:05:07.778 --> 00:05:10.303
vos hot pasirt in nayntsn fertsik

00:05:11.102 --> 00:05:13.458
nokh, ir hot aroys fun militer?

00:05:13.228 --> 00:05:21.046
nu, un nokh un n- un n- ven ikh bin aroys funem militer, muz ikh zogn nokh a tsvey a, a tsvey, ven m'hot a p- nayntsn fertsik hobn di rusn

00:05:21.046 --> 00:05:23.786
hobn bafrayt Besarabye.

00:05:25.446 --> 00:05:33.467
in nayntsn fertsik hobn di rusn bafrayt Besarabye, hot men gedarft, iz geven aza min kontrakt mit der rumenisher armey, es zoln oplozn di

00:05:33.467 --> 00:05:35.480
besarabishe soldatn aheym.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:38.754
iz

00:05:39.115 --> 00:05:40.419
befor dem

00:05:40.419 --> 00:05:42.562
hot men mir gegibn a bisl urloyb

00:05:42.562 --> 00:05:45.794
az ikh bin geforn aheym oyf urloyb, der kapitan

00:05:45.794 --> 00:05:47.732
⟨hot, zol men⟩ brengen matones

00:05:47.755 --> 00:05:49.841
hob ikh im gebrakht matones

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:51.480
keday tsu dermonen

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.552
tsvey indikes mit zeks sh- shmeyshlekh

00:05:54.552 --> 00:05:55.514
karakul

00:05:55.514 --> 00:05:57.401
shmoyshn fun lemlekh

00:05:57.576 --> 00:06:00.844
un ikh hob farshpetikt oyf tsvantsik minut in der kazarme

00:06:00.883 --> 00:06:05.419
iz der vos er iz gevezn in, in der, in, in PATRUL iz gevezn

00:06:05.419 --> 00:06:08.415
er hot, hot er m- hot er m- mikh bashtroft.

00:06:08.415 --> 00:06:12.085
m'hot mir geheysn, m'hot aropgelozt bay mir, antshuldikt, mit di hoyzn

00:06:12.085 --> 00:06:14.035
un m'hot mikh geshlogn mit a shtekn

00:06:14.035 --> 00:06:16.395
az der shtekn hot zikh tsebrokhn dray mol

00:06:16.395 --> 00:06:18.145
hot er geheysn me zol brengen

00:06:18.145 --> 00:06:20.067
a, a, fun o- fun a boym

00:06:20.067 --> 00:06:22.078
a opraysn a puzhele

00:06:22.078 --> 00:06:26.468
aza min vos se beygt zikh, zol zikh nisht tsebrekhn, un hot mikh geshlogn az biz haynt tsu tog

00:06:26.468 --> 00:06:29.052
iz mayn NERVOUS sisteme tseshoklt.

00:06:29.892 --> 00:06:33.061
un d- un zikh geyn baklogn hob ikh nit getort.

00:06:33.061 --> 00:06:36.041
ikh hob getun a feler vos ikh hob im nit gebrakht keyn matone.

00:06:36.068 --> 00:06:37.142
ot derfar.

00:06:38.127 --> 00:06:39.001
dan

00:06:39.001 --> 00:06:43.962
iz gevezn organizirt a CHOIR. kh'muz dos zogn. organizirt a CHOIR

00:06:43.962 --> 00:06:46.339
fun, fun di, fun militer

00:06:48.555 --> 00:06:50.709
un m'hot gedarft hobn a SOLO

00:06:51.627 --> 00:06:53.916
un s'iz nit geven ver zol zingen di SOLO

00:06:54.192 --> 00:06:56.146
hot der kolonel

00:06:56.146 --> 00:06:59.282
hot gezogt az keyn yidn zol men nit araynnemen in CHOIR

00:06:59.406 --> 00:07:00.412
s'iz gevezn

00:07:00.638 --> 00:07:03.045
far ale genereler geven a kontsert.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:07.617
di TETERISTN di studentn di g- merer gelernt hobn gedarft anteylnemen

00:07:07.742 --> 00:07:09.732
un ikh bin nisht geven keyn TETERIST

00:07:09.732 --> 00:07:12.262
un keyn yi- a yid hot er nisht getort arayngeyn

00:07:12.262 --> 00:07:16.352
hob ikh mikh ⟨untergez- azoy gezungen⟩, un zey hobn gezungen falsh der, der, der SOLOIST

00:07:16.352 --> 00:07:20.051
bin ikh arayngan tsum CHOIR CONDUCTOR. der CHOIR CONDUCTOR iz geven fun Bukarest

00:07:20.051 --> 00:07:21.801
funem natsyonaln CHOIR

00:07:21.801 --> 00:07:23.764
CONDUCTOR vos er hot gezungen farn kenig

00:07:23.764 --> 00:07:24.904
ot der CONDUCTOR.

00:07:24.909 --> 00:07:29.015
hot er gehert mayn VOICE, hot er mikh arayngeshtelt in CHOIR un hot mir gegibn di SOLO.

00:07:29.055 --> 00:07:31.634
az er hot mir gegibn di SOLO, s'iz gekumen tsum letst-

00:07:31.634 --> 00:07:35.114
tsu der GENERALE, GENERALE REHEARSAL, repetitsye

00:07:35.114 --> 00:07:37.274
iz gekumen der kolonel der antisemit

00:07:37.274 --> 00:07:41.184
un ikh hob ongehoybn zingen, hot er im avekgenumen un hot gezogt "vos host oysgeshtelt a JID-

00:07:41.184 --> 00:07:42.611
a JIDANE zingen?"

00:07:42.611 --> 00:07:44.104
zogt er "s'hot nisht ver."

00:07:44.104 --> 00:07:45.114
hot er gezogt

00:07:45.373 --> 00:07:46.413
"ELIMINATE"

00:07:46.892 --> 00:07:48.642
hot mikh avekgeshtelt in a zayt

00:07:48.642 --> 00:07:50.942
un hot gegibn a, an, a bariton

00:07:50.942 --> 00:07:53.742
yener bariton, s'iz gekumen tsum kon- tsum kontsert

00:07:53.742 --> 00:07:55.262
hot er zikh, iz er

00:07:55.262 --> 00:07:57.908
gefaln. er hot nisht gekent zingen. s'hot zikh

00:07:57.908 --> 00:07:58.912
COLLAPSED

00:07:58.912 --> 00:08:02.810
UNK, hot men mikh, iz er aroyfgelofn mitn revolver un hot im gevolt shisn.

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.280
s'iz geven a groyse bushe.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.042
er iz geven a groyser antisemit.

00:08:06.042 --> 00:08:08.908
hot er gezogt "keyner vet UNK nit zingen akhuts LINKOVSKY."

00:08:09.083 --> 00:08:12.418
hot er geheysn shoyn mir ikh zol zingen di tsveyte, a ⟨doyne⟩.

00:08:13.234 --> 00:08:14.932
AFTER, nokh dem

00:08:15.192 --> 00:08:16.623
az ikh hob gezungen

00:08:16.623 --> 00:08:21.243
ikh fleg z- mayn ⟨funktsye⟩ iz gevezn azoy vi ikh bin gevezn a shnayder, ikh hob gekent shnayderay

00:08:21.243 --> 00:08:24.483
az ikh zol putsn un, un presn di kleyder fun di

00:08:24.483 --> 00:08:25.673
groyse ofitsirn.

00:08:25.673 --> 00:08:28.908
hot men mir genumen tsu dem kolonel putsn un presn

00:08:28.908 --> 00:08:32.418
iz aroysgegangen di kolonelshe un hot m- di froy zayne, un hot gezogt

00:08:32.418 --> 00:08:34.858
"du host gezungen in a sinagoge? JIDAN

00:08:34.858 --> 00:08:37.168
vi kumt es az du zolst geyn zingen dortn ⟨nor⟩?"

00:08:37.168 --> 00:08:41.248
un ikh hob epes pinktlekh hob ikh dortn epes nisht azoy oysgeputst di kleyder

00:08:41.248 --> 00:08:43.808
hot zi mir gegebn tsen teg UNK

00:08:43.845 --> 00:08:44.686
zi

00:08:44.686 --> 00:08:45.949
vayl ikh bin a yid

00:08:45.972 --> 00:08:48.002
"du host gezungen in a SYNAGOGUE.

00:08:48.002 --> 00:08:50.387
vi kumstu du zolst zingen in dem CHOIR?"

00:08:51.068 --> 00:08:55.955
nokh dem muz ikh dermonen a moment ven m'hot aroysgeshikt ale soldatn tsurik in BESARABYE

00:08:57.312 --> 00:09:00.495
hot men aroysgevarfn di soldatn durkh di fentster

00:09:00.889 --> 00:09:03.195
fun di, fun di ts- funem tsug

00:09:03.808 --> 00:09:07.036
yidishe soldatn vos zenen geven ongetun in di UNIFORMS.

00:09:07.036 --> 00:09:08.906
ikh b- mir hot geglikt vos ikh hob

00:09:08.906 --> 00:09:10.706
ikh hob gehat a kuzine in IASI

00:09:10.706 --> 00:09:12.706
hob ikh mikh ongetun tsivil

00:09:12.706 --> 00:09:14.516
hot men mikh nisht aroysgevarfn

00:09:14.516 --> 00:09:16.016
nor be- befor

00:09:16.016 --> 00:09:20.684
ikh hob, m'hot mikh opgelozt, un der ofitsir vos er iz gevezn UNK, vos er iz geven der SHOMER

00:09:20.684 --> 00:09:23.470
hot er gezogt "m'vet dikh aroysvorfn, du forst aheym

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:25.550
m'vet dikh aroysvorfn funem TRAIN

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:28.806
un du ⟨vest derhargenen⟩ UNK ⟨vest⟩ nisht dergreykhn aheym.

00:09:28.806 --> 00:09:30.923
nor s'iz mir nisht gornit layt.

00:09:30.923 --> 00:09:33.148
s'iz mir nor layt dayn VOICE."

00:09:33.255 --> 00:09:35.125
zog ikh "fun vanen veystu mayn VOICE?"

00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:37.645
zogt er "ikh hob dikh gehert zingen oyf dem kontsert."

00:09:38.098 --> 00:09:44.082
ikh bin aheym, bin aheymgeforn. m'hot undz bagleyt. ikh bin aheymgeforn mit groyse tsores. s'iz geven pogromen. s'iz geven

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:47.030
soldatn yidishe, m'hot zey aroysgevarfn durkh di fentster

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:49.060
ven der tsug iz iz gegl- gelofn.

00:09:49.607 --> 00:09:52.200
ikh bin aheymgekumen in nayntn fertsik loyt ayer

00:09:52.206 --> 00:09:53.932
loyt ayer

00:09:53.932 --> 00:09:56.671
frage vos ir shtelt mir

00:09:56.695 --> 00:09:58.092
vos iz forgekumen

00:09:58.092 --> 00:10:01.531
in nayntsn fertsik iber di grenets hobn di soldatn, di rusishe

00:10:01.588 --> 00:10:02.662
hobn shoyn ge-

00:10:02.702 --> 00:10:06.746
un, un di rumenishe hobn tsugenumen aldings. di rusishe hobn ge- v-

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:09.440
UNK hobn zey gekoyft di zeygerlekh.

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:10.782
kh'hob gehat eyn zeygerl

00:10:10.782 --> 00:10:13.786
hot er, hot er gekoyft, mir gegibn aza min prayz

00:10:13.786 --> 00:10:16.356
vos ikh hob es farkoyft, ikh zol ⟨zey⟩ aleyn brengen

00:10:16.356 --> 00:10:18.396
aheym a zak mit mel

00:10:18.683 --> 00:10:21.523
hob ikh es farkoyft un bin aheymgekumen, hob ikh aheymgebrakht

00:10:21.523 --> 00:10:26.692
hobn mir gekoyft mel mit kartofl tsulib dem vos s'iz gevorn teykef a hunger ven di rusn zenen arayngekumen.

00:10:26.142 --> 00:10:29.764
ayere eltern hobn nokh gevoynt dort mit di shvester?

00:10:28.133 --> 00:10:30.243
mayne eltern hobn dortn gevoynt

00:10:30.243 --> 00:10:31.973
in dem varshtat f- hobn

00:10:31.973 --> 00:10:34.503
di rusn hobn teykef ongehoybn tsu makhn a ordenung

00:10:34.503 --> 00:10:39.399
az mayn foter iz, hot gehat arbetorers vos zey hobn gearbet bay im, hot er geheysn a ekspluatator

00:10:39.507 --> 00:10:43.331
hot men tsugenumen bay im dem varshtat, un m'hot di arbetorers tselozt

00:10:43.455 --> 00:10:48.106
