00:21:34.915 --> 00:21:37.119
hobn, hobn gemakht pogrom

00:21:37.277 --> 00:21:39.178
un m'hot barabevet di yidn

00:21:39.403 --> 00:21:41.067
vos iz geblibn dortn.

00:21:41.192 --> 00:21:43.594
ober mayn muter iz geven zeyer a kluge froy

00:21:43.594 --> 00:21:46.488
eyne fun di shenste un di kligste froyen

00:21:46.488 --> 00:21:48.352
vos me flegt tsun ir kumen

00:21:48.352 --> 00:21:51.474
tsvishn di shenste, oyb meg ikh zogn, un di klugste

00:21:51.474 --> 00:21:55.158
flegt tsun ir kumen nokh eytses, un zi hot getun a sakh mitsves

00:21:56.262 --> 00:21:58.551
hot zi oyfgerisn di kishn

00:21:58.776 --> 00:22:00.730
un hot aroysgelozt di federn

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:02.550
un hot oysgezetst di fentster

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:07.740
un s'iz gefloygn federn mit di fentster. zenen zey durkhgangen di banditn, hobn zey gezogt "do iz men shoyn geven"

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:12.979
un ale dos gantse guts hot zi gebahaltn oyfn boydem. ⟨der⟩ leyter hot zi tsugenumen ⟨un⟩ hot farvorfn in an ander hoyf.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:16.606
zenen durkhgangen di pogrom, iz zi gangen, hot aropgenumen di zakhn.

00:22:16.545 --> 00:22:19.137
hobn zey nokh gekent blaybn in zeyer heym?

00:22:19.195 --> 00:22:25.941
n- in der heym zenen zey geblibn. zi, iz zi hot men farnumen. der seminar iz dortn. es iz gevezn a REGIMENT fun soldatn

00:22:25.941 --> 00:22:27.963
un zi hot gearbet in kikh.

00:22:28.392 --> 00:22:31.721
geven a gute kekherin in der heym, un zi hot g- dortn gearbet in kikh.

00:22:31.721 --> 00:22:33.780
shpeter hot men zey ale

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:36.573
mitn gantsn marsh fun andere shtetlekh

00:22:36.573 --> 00:22:37.497
hot men

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:41.407
in, vos m'hot getun in Yedinits, hot men aroysgenumen di REST fun di bakhurim

00:22:41.407 --> 00:22:44.968
aroysgenumen oyfn besoylem vos ikh vel shpeter vayzn di

00:22:44.968 --> 00:22:46.644
khaverishe kvorim

00:22:46.785 --> 00:22:50.283
vos m'hot opgeshnitn di oyern un di nez un dernokh dem geharget

00:22:50.283 --> 00:22:51.673
un m'hot zey bagrobn

00:22:52.185 --> 00:22:53.760
di shenste yugnt

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.059
un yidn

00:22:55.059 --> 00:22:56.755
d- oyf dem besoylem

00:22:56.755 --> 00:22:59.514
un d- mayn mamen mit di kinder hot men getribn

00:22:59.514 --> 00:23:00.594
in dem marsh

00:23:00.594 --> 00:23:02.861
hot zi mit di zakhn vos zi hot

00:23:03.238 --> 00:23:06.930
aropgenumen funem boydem, hot zi bavizn tsu dingen a

00:23:06.930 --> 00:23:09.239
tsvey ferd mit a furl, zol forn

00:23:09.263 --> 00:23:13.014
vifl zi hot gehat zakhn hot zi geklekt.

00:23:13.014 --> 00:23:16.142
dernokh dem hot men shoyn gedarft geyn tsu fus. zi hot dos farkoyft

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:17.908
un m'hot zi shoyn nisht gefirt

00:23:17.908 --> 00:23:20.090
un zenen ongekumen keyn Rezine.

00:23:20.805 --> 00:23:22.064
in Rezine

00:23:22.122 --> 00:23:25.440
iz gevezn a selektsye, geven a, a ⟨volt⟩

00:23:25.513 --> 00:23:26.649
Vertuzhen.

00:23:26.649 --> 00:23:30.607
in dem Vertuzhen iz gevezn a selektsye. ver se, hot men oysgeteylt

00:23:30.607 --> 00:23:33.349
ver s'hot gehat mazl iz gegangen links, un ver s'hot gehat

00:23:33.349 --> 00:23:35.095
nisht keyn mazl gegangen rekhts.

00:23:35.095 --> 00:23:37.033
UNFORTUNATELY mayn muter

00:23:37.107 --> 00:23:38.462
mit Yentele

00:23:38.462 --> 00:23:41.077
mitn ⟨un⟩ tsveytn shvesterl mit Malkele

00:23:41.077 --> 00:23:42.587
zenen gegangen rekhts.

00:23:42.587 --> 00:23:47.197
di ale vos zenen gangen oyf Rezine rekhts zenen farbrent gevorn in a kalekh oyvn

00:23:47.197 --> 00:23:48.845
vu me makht tsigl.

00:23:49.628 --> 00:23:51.473
keyner iz nisht geblibn lebn.

00:23:51.473 --> 00:23:52.822
eyn mentsh

00:23:52.822 --> 00:23:55.303
iz geblibn lebn vos fun im hobn mir oysgefunen

00:23:55.303 --> 00:23:58.264
vos er iz gevezn in der khevre kedishe

00:23:58.264 --> 00:24:00.438
vos er hot bagrobn di meysim

00:24:00.715 --> 00:24:05.923
un er iz geven shtark, a shtarker mentsh. m'hot oysgekloybn di shtarkste. yene hot men do oysgeshosn

00:24:05.946 --> 00:24:09.686
un im hot men oykh geshosn, ober er hot zikh gebahaltn unter di meysim.

00:24:09.810 --> 00:24:14.141
un er hot bavizn tsu antloyfn. er iz aheymgekumen. Faytl hot er geheysn.

00:24:14.383 --> 00:24:17.482
geven a shtarker yid, a ba- balegole gevezn.

00:24:17.505 --> 00:24:19.861
un er hot dertseylt vos iz forgekumen.

00:24:20.526 --> 00:24:23.560
fun im hot mayn bruder oysgefunen, Zelik

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:25.228
un nokh dem hot er mir

00:24:26.010 --> 00:24:28.606
dertseylt vos iz forgekumen mit mayn

00:24:28.606 --> 00:24:30.606
mamen un mit di shvesterlekh

00:24:30.606 --> 00:24:33.010
un mayn shvesterl hot gehat a BACHUR.

00:24:33.010 --> 00:24:38.239
er iz a lerer, iz er oykhet gegangen mit ir tsuzamen dortn, iz er oykhet umgekumen.

00:24:38.920 --> 00:24:41.496
iz zent ir geven in di tsayt

00:24:41.518 --> 00:24:42.963
di gantse tsayt

00:24:42.970 --> 00:24:44.586
in di armey.

00:24:43.915 --> 00:24:45.023
in der armey.

00:24:45.349 --> 00:24:48.093
un ven di milkhome hot zikh farendikt

00:24:48.808 --> 00:24:51.485
hot ir gevust az se endikt zikh shoyn?

00:24:52.217 --> 00:24:56.272
az di milkhome hot zikh farendikt, hob ikh nisht gevust vu mayne eltern

00:24:56.272 --> 00:25:00.930
vu mayne kinder, vu zey zenen. efsher zenen zey ahertsun evakuirt ahertsu

00:25:00.930 --> 00:25:03.174
un efsher lebt emetser fun zey.

00:25:03.174 --> 00:25:06.133
mir ho'mir gevust az di yidn hot men

00:25:06.291 --> 00:25:08.836
di letste teg fun milkhome, vayl ikh bin gevezn

00:25:08.836 --> 00:25:11.161
in Rumenye bin ikh gegangen

00:25:11.775 --> 00:25:13.620
in Budapest in Ungarn

00:25:13.620 --> 00:25:15.518
in CZECHSLOVAKIA, in VIENNA

00:25:15.518 --> 00:25:18.193
un ot o di ale groyse shtet un shtetlekh

00:25:18.193 --> 00:25:22.327
hob ikh oy- hob ikh gezen a sakh ibergeblibene sheyres hapleyte

00:25:22.327 --> 00:25:26.551
velekhe zenen gekumen betn bay mir, vayl ikh hob gehat a sakh produktn. ikh bin geven der

00:25:26.558 --> 00:25:29.761
der shef iber di zakhn. zenen gekumen betn bay mir broyt

00:25:29.761 --> 00:25:31.040
un ikh hob mikh oysge-

00:25:31.047 --> 00:25:34.450
oysgefregt far zey vos iz mit zey forgekumen

00:25:35.502 --> 00:25:41.438
un ikh bin geven STARSHINA, hot men mikh geshikt az ikh zol makhn a mobilizatsye fun finef hundert soldatn

00:25:41.438 --> 00:25:44.540
velekhe zey zenen ibergeblibn nokh di daytshn.

00:25:44.547 --> 00:25:47.837
un, dortn ⟨BETOYKHEM⟩ iz geven yidn ⟨vos⟩ zenen geven in di lagern

00:25:47.837 --> 00:25:50.727
hobn zey UNK, hobn zey mir dertseylt vos iz gevezn

00:25:50.727 --> 00:25:51.898
hob ikh gehat a anung

00:25:52.917 --> 00:25:56.792
vegn deroyf, ober ikh hob mikh dokh ⟨gerekhnt⟩ az s'iz emetser geblibn lebn.

00:25:57.473 --> 00:26:01.376
un ven, ven ikh bin

00:26:01.376 --> 00:26:02.903
gevezn in

00:26:02.903 --> 00:26:04.219
in Budapest

00:26:04.219 --> 00:26:07.147
hob ikh gehat a

00:26:07.147 --> 00:26:08.329
a farbindung

00:26:08.329 --> 00:26:11.270
mit zh- yidn velekhe zenen geblibn

00:26:11.428 --> 00:26:13.717
lebn fun zeyere lagern.

00:26:13.234 --> 00:26:15.388
ven zent ir geven in Budapest?

00:26:15.647 --> 00:26:20.045
in Budapest bin ikh gevezn in fir un fertsik un in finef un fertsik.

00:26:20.052 --> 00:26:22.763
vi azoy zent ir gekumen dort? mit di armey?

00:26:22.330 --> 00:26:23.454
mit der armey.

00:26:23.781 --> 00:26:25.462
un vos hot ir getun dort?

00:26:25.789 --> 00:26:27.437
ikh bin gevezn

00:26:27.915 --> 00:26:30.553
azoy gezogt, ikh kon nisht dos onrufn oyf English

00:26:30.553 --> 00:26:31.943
ikh bin gevezn

00:26:31.943 --> 00:26:35.463
der farantvortlekh vos er zol tsushteln produktn far mayne

00:26:35.463 --> 00:26:36.703
far mayn UNIT.

00:26:36.741 --> 00:26:40.701
ikh farshtey. ober dos iz oykhet geven afile ven ir zent geven in Budapest.

00:26:40.588 --> 00:26:41.324
yo.

00:26:40.701 --> 00:26:42.841
di gantse tsayt hot ir dos getun.

00:26:42.841 --> 00:26:46.301
di gan- di f- di gantse tsayt hobn mir nokhgefolgt dem front. mayne

00:26:46.301 --> 00:26:48.511
mayn UNIT iz gevezn vos er hot

00:26:48.511 --> 00:26:49.071
di

00:26:49.071 --> 00:26:52.151
⟨mayne, maynorn, m- maynes⟩ vos zey hobn

00:26:52.151 --> 00:26:54.608
vos zey raysn oyf di min- mines.

00:26:54.608 --> 00:26:56.225
ir veyst vos heyst a mine?

00:26:56.738 --> 00:27:00.633
vos me leygt unter unter di tanken, leygt unter, der vos me rayst o- MINES.

00:26:58.973 --> 00:26:59.983
MINES.

00:27:00.633 --> 00:27:02.368
mir zenen geven ⟨maynorn⟩

00:27:02.458 --> 00:27:05.152
mir zenen gevezn, mir ho'mir geboyt brikn

00:27:05.277 --> 00:27:08.907
velekhe me zol, di brikn, ale vos zenen gevezn, BRIDGES

00:27:08.907 --> 00:27:12.107
vos zenen geven oyfgerisn fun di daytshn un fun di rumener

00:27:12.107 --> 00:27:13.196
un fun di andere

00:27:13.196 --> 00:27:13.997
hobn mir

00:27:13.997 --> 00:27:15.057
⟨zey⟩ gedarft

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:16.560
hobn a

00:27:16.836 --> 00:27:21.448
CONNECTION. m'hot zey gedarft iberm- -makh- funem Dnyester, funem Prut

00:27:21.448 --> 00:27:25.928
un fun ⟨dem⟩ TISA, un fun der i- fun der v-

00:27:26.915 --> 00:27:30.026
Duna- DUNAREA, funem Dunay

00:27:30.420 --> 00:27:32.138
 Budapest.

00:27:32.138 --> 00:27:38.294
dortn hobn mir gehat a sakh, finef un tsvantsik brikn tsu boyen, me zol k- hobn, di armey zol konen aribergeyn.

00:27:39.162 --> 00:27:40.761
iz vos hot pasirt

00:27:40.761 --> 00:27:42.094
bay di ende

00:27:41.035 --> 00:27:46.145
un ikh hob zey gefirt oyfn front. dos iz geven, bay der linye front. ikh fleg zey firn produktn

00:27:46.145 --> 00:27:47.238
un hobn

00:27:47.599 --> 00:27:51.393
 un, un, tsu gibn esn di, di soldatn

00:27:51.393 --> 00:27:52.760
un vesh

00:27:52.760 --> 00:27:55.557
un zey zenen gevezn in der transhey

00:27:55.699 --> 00:27:57.181
in di okopes.
